+The record store exposes authenticated operations for visit submission, single-visit and filtered visit listing (`current` or `needs_review`), revision-history retrieval, and coordinator resolution. Persistence keeps every accepted submission and coordinator resolution as an immutable revision in the visit's revision graph, recording its author, server receipt time, parent revision IDs (`parent_revision_ids`), and full visit payload.
 
